v0.1.9.0-beta — Eco Mode + Usage Statistics for Secondary Provider & Eco Mode

Eco Mode:
- Per-provider Eco Mode toggle to reduce output tokens
- Appends conciseness instruction to system prompt when enabled
- Removes filler words, pleasantries, and unnecessary explanations
- Recommended for cloud API providers to save costs

Usage Statistics — Eco Mode & Secondary Provider Tracking:
- New eco_mode and secondary_used columns in usage_stats (schema v3)
- Auto-migration from schema v2 to v3 (safe ALTER TABLE)
- Track eco_mode flag on every chat completion
- Track secondary provider LLM calls from memory engine
- Stats API returns eco savings (avg eco vs normal output, tokens saved)
- Stats API returns secondary provider usage (calls, tokens)

Dashboard — New Statistics Cards:
- Eco Mode card: Eco Requests, Tokens Saved, Avg Output (eco vs normal)
- Secondary Provider card: Secondary Calls, Secondary Tokens

i18n:
- All new stats and eco mode keys in EN and RO
